      "message": "For completeness, could we also exclude Delete (called \"Delete Forward\" in the usage tables), Page Up, Page Down, Home, and End? (usages 74–78, 0x4A–0x4E in the usage tables [0]) According to our specs [1], those should only be present when there\u0027s a keypad, so it would be nice to exclude them otherwise.\n\n[0]: https://www.usb.org/sites/default/files/documents/hut1_12v2.pdf\n[1]: https://chromeos.google.com/partner/dlm/docs/hardware-specs/keyboardspec.html",
      "revId": "6119579ffd4ba70656d4f501d1b0d44658f408da",
