      },
      "lineNbr": 190,
      "author": {
        "id": 1141739
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-24T04:32:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That matches my understanding on internal keyboards.\nCan we also hardcode detachable keyboards in the same way?",
      "parentUuid": "7cf67296_4e3af042",
      "revId": "6119579ffd4ba70656d4f501d1b0d44658f408da",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "48b4c0d0_3e7215c8",
        "filename": "chip/stm32/usb_hid_keyboard.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 190,
      "author": {
        "id": 1289152
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-24T18:46:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could (and we will be keeping a list of detachable keyboard product IDs in the diagnostics tool I\u0027m working on), but we would prefer not to for maintainability reasons. We also have b/178750284 to hopefully remove the need to hard-code number pad presence for internal keyboards.",
      "parentUuid": "a6ebf9d9_6cde6c55",
      "revId": "6119579ffd4ba70656d4f501d1b0d44658f408da",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
